    "S22"
  ],
  "solution_ref": "$x\\{f+g\\}=12x^3+24x^2-6x$ → $xg'+g=12x^2+24x-6$ → $xg=4x^3+12x^2-6x$ → $g=4x^2+12x-6$. $\\int_0^3g=36+54-18=72$",
